<article class="env-definition" id="03G7">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/03G7">Definition <span data-tag="03G7">66.21.2</span>.</a> Let $S$ be a scheme. Let $X$ be an algebraic space over $S$. The <em>structure sheaf</em> of $X$ is the sheaf of rings $\mathcal{O}_ X$ on the small étale site $X_{\acute{e}tale}$ described in Lemma <a href="/tag/03G6" data-tag="03G6">66.21.1</a>. </p>
